{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/d31503f70916835e85d35fd2c67a309a.poster.avif?t=1772553555\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/d31503f70916835e85d35fd2c67a309a.webm?t=1772553555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the myth-shrouded lands where the hunter Ro begins her journey to bring her son back from the dead. Immerse yourself in the depths of the Spirit World, fractured into <strong>4 realms</strong> and scarred with <strong>13 distinct regions</strong>. Confront over <strong>30 enemy types</strong> and harness the potential of <strong>more than 160 cards</strong>, forging <strong>unique archetypes</strong> and a multitude of powerful combinations. A dark journey awaits you, spanning<strong> 25+ hours of gameplay</strong>, with numerous enthralling side quests and grim boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/5e2f8a4f7cc03e5c4807fdf6687e7965.avif?t=1772553555\" width=780 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft <strong>over 160 cards</strong> and fashion synergistic decks that focus on <strong>poison, strength, sacrifice, retaliation, backstabbing, blocking, movement</strong>, and more. Discover shamanic totems with unique effects to enhance your deck. Each new element allows you to tailor your <strong>tactical style</strong> as you prepare for your next deadly encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/79b3546a55e531fe30b3d8a5dceb3b8b.poster.avif?t=1772553555\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/79b3546a55e531fe30b3d8a5dceb3b8b.webm?t=1772553555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/2dd3e7f7f23f4b23f61ef912950cae0f.avif?t=1772553555\" width=780 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a host of restless spirits - Skulldogs, Crackle Bursts, Woeful Seashrooms and more - in <strong>grid-based battles where each move is crucial</strong>. Test your wit by fighting unique enemy types, powerful bosses, and mini-bosses, all while taking into account environmental hazards and boons. Grow stronger, adapt your deck, and choose your battles as you explore a vast world filled with dangerous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/691fa9d701ca559d662368e396ff4113.avif?t=1772553555\" width=780 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In forgotten lands shrouded by myth, Ro - a hunter from a small tribe - is overcome by grief following the death of her beloved son. Guided by voices from another world, she transcends into the realm of spirits, in hopes of bringing him back. <strong>Meet strange spirits and help them with quests and challenges that affect your deck</strong> \u2013 although not all of them may have your best interests at heart. Discover a mysterious world of <strong>forgotten lore</strong>, where darkness whispers secrets and invites you to unearth buried memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/49ee746f457a975b845f4bf9b306ddc5.poster.avif?t=1772553555\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825880/extras/49ee746f457a975b845f4bf9b306ddc5.webm?t=1772553555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Balancing the Scales","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2825880/91353d6cb1f4dda1e906e54f2590ddd04cbf3e34.jpg"},{"name":"The Last Howl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2825880/5c1ce4c553be374862dd719dbc87bf2d3ae8b001.jpg"},{"name":"Shattered Delusions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2825880/53809723cea39fcb654bd400ad7069c4aff1a9e3.jpg"},{"name":"Drowned Lament","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2825880/e30262a5649b227db86bdb848bf18eb2ebbc12cf.jpg"},{"name":"Withered Wrath","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2825880/12ad6294166183e3eb7fcec5c79697e9adaaf9aa.jpg"},{"name":"Decayed Denial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2825880/f75b88e3188d635b6c85a787ef27f7b6add6514d.jpg"},{"name":"Reap or Weep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2825880/e08f48591da82cf3aae5432cf43c3d5af915f54e.jpg"},{"name":"Flames of Vengeance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2825880/d6eb3db06cbc85ff1806937ce927e4f92b56789c.jpg"},{"name":"In Search of Beauty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2825880/92bd655eb6ce1f5c13eb36739a137ce0766a3300.jpg"},{"name":"Scattered Senses","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity